OL,3,GNEWSAI'm a wildlife cameraman but
OL,4,A'special' rare sightings can still take
OL,5,Ame by surprise
OL,6,
OL,7,FA wildlife cinematographer and shark
OL,8,Fguide has spoken about the unexpected
OL,9,Fsurprise and joy of seeing a humpback
OL,10,Fwhale in the Celtic Deep just off the
OL,11,FWelsh coast.
OL,13,FDan Abbot, known as Sharkman Dan on his
OL,14,Fsocial media, shared a recording of the
OL,15,Fexciting moment just off the
OL,16,FPembrokeshire coast.
OL,18,FHe has seen the large marine mammals
OL,19,Fbefore, on planned trips where humpback
OL,20,Fwhale sightings are not as unusual, but
OL,21,Fthis experience was "a complete
OL,22,Fsurprise".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
