OL,3,GNEWSAI'm a wildlife cameraman but
OL,4,A'special' rare sightings can still take
OL,5,Ame by surprise
OL,6,
OL,7,FLloyd Nelmes from Sea Trust said the
OL,8,Fsighting was "unusual for someone who
OL,9,Fworks in the field... who probably has
OL,10,Ftheir eyes on the water every day",
OL,11,Fadding, "for a normal person, it's
OL,12,Finsanely rare".
